WEBVTT

00:07:59.468 --> 00:08:02.249
nismo pričali o gojaznosti.

00:08:02.249 --> 00:08:07.260
I tako, u novogodišnjoj noći 2007. godine,

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.299
otišao sam u zoo vrt,

00:08:09.299 --> 00:08:11.720
i stao ispred slonova,

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.583
i rekao &amp;quot;Grad ide na dijetu,

00:08:15.583 --> 00:08:19.202
i izgubićemo bar 500 000 kilograma."

00:08:19.202 --> 00:08:20.975
I tad je sve krenulo naopako.

00:08:20.975 --> 00:08:23.753
(Smeh)

00:08:23.753 --> 00:08:25.636
Nacionalni mediji

00:08:25.636 --> 00:08:30.153
su neposredno težili ka ovoj priči,